      "observed": "The netlist contains no R1 component. Net-(Q1-S) has only C14.1, J1.3, and Q1.2, so Q1's source is not returned through the specified 0.47 Ω current-sense resistor to GND.",
      "expected": "The specification requires R1 = 0.47 Ω between the EPD boost switch source and GND as the booster current-sense resistor, with J1.3 tied to that source node.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R1 | 0.47 Ω current-sense resistor | EPD booster current-limit sense"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Q1's source (`Net-(Q1-S)`) returns through `R1` (0.47 Ω) to GND and also feeds back to `J1.3`"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"39\") (name \"Net-(Q1-S)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C14\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"J1\") (pin \"3\") (pinfunction \"3\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"Q1\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"S\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The EPD boost converter current-sense/feedback path is open. The booster may fail to regulate, fail to start, or lose current limiting, preventing reliable e-paper display operation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["C1"],
      "pins": ["C1.1", "C1.2"],
      "nets": ["GND", "Display_Power_Switch"],
      "observed": "C1 is specified in the netlist as 0.1uF/16V.",
      "expected": "The specification lists C1 among the EPD charge-pump/default capacitors that should be 1uF/25V.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C1\") (value \"0.1uF/16V\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "C2 default: 1 µF/25 V | C1/C5/C7/C8/C9/C10 = 1 µF/25 V | Matches default"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"9\") (name \"Display_Power_Switch\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C1\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The display-power node has less bulk decoupling than intended and a lower voltage rating than specified, which can increase ripple/noise and may affect EPD boost or panel stability.",
      "confidence": 0.6
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The build deviates from the intended Meshinger design: the EPD booster current-sense resistor R1 is absent, breaking the boost converter feedback/current-limit path, and C1 is 0.1uF/16V instead of the specified 1uF/25V."
}

